            "review_title": "Review at Okbingsul Mipec Tower",
            "review_text": "JSTrip_77\nSarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina1194 contributions\n0\nFirst experience with binsu - very interesting and tasty!\nNov 2018 • Couples\nWe didn't really know what to expect but were up for a little adventure so we stopped in. We both got chocolate which was delicious but didn't give us the option to try multiple flavors. That was a bust on our part. But, this is a delicious and light desert. If it was loaded with calories, it didn't feel that way. It wasn't overly sweet and was the perfect end (almost) to a nice long bike-borne exploration of metro Hanoi.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 25, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
