            "review_title": "Review at Okbingsul Mipec Tower",
            "review_text": "HangMinh0803\nHanoi, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nThe patbingsu lover's heaven\nSep 2016 • Friends\nThe patbingsu in Okbingsul VN tastes totally diffirent from other stores i had tried before. The Patbingsuls are not too sweet but smell nice and the fruits are really fresh. I recommend Tropical Bingsu for people who come here in very first time. Matcha Bingsu and Injeolmi Bingsu are also two must-try flavors here. Definitely comeback!!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 5, 2016",
