            "review_title": "Review at Okbingsul Mipec Tower",
            "review_text": "Peace R\n5 contributions\n0\nAwesome place for patbingsu lover in Hanoi\nAug 2016 • Friends\nI have visited many patbingsu stores in Hanoi, but Okbingsul is the place that I want to recommend for people that are truly Korean dessert lover. Bingsu is made with 100% Korean ingredients, which allow me to taste premium Korean sherbet without flying to Korea :). The decoration is warm with cute staff. Definitely comeback !!!\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 22, 2016",
